option.PT_UPSCALE_FILTER=Upscale Filter
option.PT_UPSCALE_FILTER.comment=Reconstruct low-resolution path-traced lighting, then restore full-resolution diffuse textures. Detail uses bounded cubic weights and surface guides; Fast uses four taps and is the Low/Med default. Detail costs more. Native lighting bypasses this filter.
option.PT_SHARPEN=Adaptive Sharpening
option.PT_SHARPEN.comment=Optional bounded HDR sharpening, suppressed by remaining transport noise. Off removes the entire pass. Diagnostic views always bypass it.
option.PT_SHARPNESS=Sharpening Strength
option.PT_SHARPNESS.comment=Controls detail contrast after upscaling. Higher values can emphasize residual grain; the noise guard and neighborhood clamp limit overshoot.
option.PT_DENOISE_PASSES=Spatial Filter Passes
option.PT_DENOISE_PASSES.comment=One pass saves a transport-resolution filter pass but leaves more noise. Two preserves the wider reconstruction used for water and clouds. Spatial Reconstruction Off skips both passes.
option.BLOOM_QUALITY=Bloom Quality
option.BLOOM_QUALITY.comment=Fast uses 9 scene samples per pixel; Fine uses 25. Changes lens glow softness, not world light transport.
